#. type: Title =
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Components and Channels in code"
msgstr "OpenEMS-Entwicklung: Komponenten und Channels im Code"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:9
msgid ""
"__As of: 2026-10-30 · OpenEMS version 2026.11.0-SNAPSHOT (development "
"version, branch develop)__"
msgstr ""
"__Stand: 30.10.2026 · OpenEMS-Version 2026.11.0-SNAPSHOT (Entwicklungsstand, "
"Branch develop)__"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The concepts are described in xref:coreconcepts.adoc[Core concepts & "
"terminology] and xref:edge/architecture.adoc[Edge Architecture]. This page "
"shows how they appear in the code of OpenEMS Edge."
msgstr ""
"Die Konzepte beschreiben xref:latest@coreconcepts.adoc[Core concepts & "
"terminology] und xref:latest@edge/architecture.adoc[Edge Architecture]. "
"Diese Seite zeigt, wie sie im Code von OpenEMS Edge aussehen."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "OSGi and bundles"
msgstr "OSGi und Bundles"

#. type: #sec-osgi-and-bundles
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:16
msgid ""
"The Edge is an OSGi application on Apache Felix. Important services from "
"`+EdgeApp.bndrun+`:"
msgstr ""
"Die Edge ist eine OSGi-Anwendung auf Apache Felix. Wichtige Dienste aus "
"`+EdgeApp.bndrun+`:"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Bundle\n"
"| Task\n"
"\n"
"| `+org.apache.felix.scr+`\n"
"| Declarative Services: creates components from `+@Component+` classes and connects `+@Reference+`s\n"
"| `+org.apache.felix.configadmin+`\n"
"| stores configurations (directory `+felix.cm.dir+`)\n"
"| `+org.apache.felix.eventadmin+`\n"
"| distributes the Cycle Events (see xref:development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc[Cycle])\n"
"| `+org.apache.felix.metatype+`\n"
"| describes configuration fields; the forms in Apache Felix Web Console and UI are created from them\n"
"| `+io.openems.core.referencetarget+`\n"
"| sets reference filters from configuration values (see xref:development/implementing/controller.adoc[Implementing a Controller])\n"
msgstr ""
"| Bundle\n"
"| Aufgabe\n"
"\n"
"| `+org.apache.felix.scr+`\n"
"| Declarative Services: erzeugt Komponenten aus `+@Component+`-Klassen und verbindet `+@Reference+`s\n"
"| `+org.apache.felix.configadmin+`\n"
"| speichert Konfigurationen (Verzeichnis `+felix.cm.dir+`)\n"
"| `+org.apache.felix.eventadmin+`\n"
"| verteilt die Zyklus-Ereignisse (siehe xref:development/fundamentals/cycle-and-ess-power.adoc[Zyklus])\n"
"| `+org.apache.felix.metatype+`\n"
"| beschreibt Konfigurationsfelder; daraus entstehen die Formulare in Webkonsole und UI\n"
"| `+io.openems.core.referencetarget+`\n"
"| setzt Referenz-Filter aus Konfigurationswerten (siehe xref:development/implementing/controller.adoc[Komponente])\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Every directory `+io.openems.*+` is a bundle. A bundle may only access "
"bundles listed in its `+-buildpath+`. Typical are API bundles (`+*.api+`, "
"e.g. `+io.openems.edge.ess.api+`) with the Natures and device bundles that "
"are programmed only against these APIs."
msgstr ""
"Jedes Verzeichnis `+io.openems.*+` ist ein Bundle. Ein Bundle darf nur auf "
"Bundles zugreifen, die in seinem `+-buildpath+` stehen. Typisch sind API-"
"Bundles (`+*.api+`, z. B. `+io.openems.edge.ess.api+`) mit den Natures und "
"Geräte-Bundles, die nur gegen diese APIs programmiert sind."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Components"
msgstr "Komponenten"

#. type: #sec-components
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:40
msgid ""
"An OpenEMS Component is a class with `+@Component+` and a configuration "
"(`+@Designate(ocd = Config.class, factory = true)+`). With `+factory = "
"true+` there can be any number of Instances, each with its own Component-ID "
"(`+meter0+`, `+meter1+` …). The name in `+@Component(name = "
"\"Meter.Janitza.UMG96RME\")+` is the **Factory-PID**; it appears in the "
"configuration and must not be changed for compatibility reasons."
msgstr ""
"Eine Komponente ist eine Klasse mit `+@Component+` und einer Konfiguration "
"(`+@Designate(ocd = Config.class, factory = true)+`). Mit `+factory = true+` "
"kann es beliebig viele Instanzen geben, jede mit eigener ID (`+meter0+`, "
"`+meter1+` …). Der Name in `+@Component(name = \"Meter.Janitza.UMG96RME\")+` "
"ist die **Factory-PID**; sie erscheint in der Konfiguration und darf aus "
"Kompatibilitätsgründen nicht geändert werden."

#. type: #sec-components
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Almost all components inherit from `+AbstractOpenemsComponent+` (devices "
"with Modbus from `+AbstractOpenemsModbusComponent+`). The base class:"
msgstr ""
"Fast alle Komponenten erben von `+AbstractOpenemsComponent+` (Geräte mit "
"Modbus von `+AbstractOpenemsModbusComponent+`). Die Basisklasse:"

#. type: #sec-components
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:44
msgid ""
"creates all Channels in the constructor whose `+ChannelId+` enums are passed,"
msgstr ""
"legt im Konstruktor alle Channels an, deren `+ChannelId+`-Enums übergeben "
"werden,"

#. type: #sec-components
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:45
msgid "sets the basic data in `+activate(context, id, alias, enabled)+`,"
msgstr "setzt in `+activate(context, id, alias, enabled)+` die Grunddaten,"

#. type: #sec-components
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:46
msgid "releases the Channels in `+deactivate()+`."
msgstr "gibt in `+deactivate()+` die Channels frei."

#. type: #sec-components
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Each component has the Nature `+OpenemsComponent+` with, among others, the "
"Channel `+State+` (overall state from all State-Channels) and error messages."
msgstr ""
"Jede Komponente hat die Nature `+OpenemsComponent+` mit u. a. den Channels "
"`+State+` (Sammelzustand aus allen State-Channels) und Fehlermeldungen."

#. type: #sec-components
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:50
msgid ""
"**Singleton components** with a fixed ID begin with an underscore, e.g. "
"`+_sum+`, `+_cycle+`, `+_componentManager+`, `+_power+`, `+_meta+`, "
"`+_appManager+`."
msgstr ""
"**Singleton-Komponenten** mit fester ID beginnen mit Unterstrich, z. B. "
"`+_sum+`, `+_cycle+`, `+_componentManager+`, `+_power+`, `+_meta+`, "
"`+_appManager+`."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Natures"
msgstr "Natures"

#. type: #sec-natures
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:55
msgid ""
"Controllers are written against Natures, not against concrete devices. "
"Examples:"
msgstr ""
"Controller programmieren gegen Natures, nicht gegen konkrete Geräte. "
"Beispiele:"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:80
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Nature\n"
"| Bundle\n"
"| Meaning\n"
"\n"
"| `+ElectricityMeter+`\n"
"| `+io.openems.edge.meter.api+`\n"
"| meter: power, voltage, current, energy; `+MeterType+` (GRID, PRODUCTION, CONSUMPTION_METERED …)\n"
"| `+SymmetricEss+`\n"
"| `+io.openems.edge.ess.api+`\n"
"| ESS: SoC, capacity, actual power\n"
"| `+ManagedSymmetricEss+`\n"
"| `+io.openems.edge.ess.api+`\n"
"| controllable ESS: setpoint Channels, `+applyPower()+`\n"
"| `+EssDcCharger+`\n"
"| `+io.openems.edge.ess.api+`\n"
"| DC-side PV on the hybrid inverter\n"
"| `+Controller+`\n"
"| `+io.openems.edge.controller.api+`\n"
"| control logic in `+run()+`\n"
"| `+Sum+`\n"
"| `+io.openems.edge.common+`\n"
"| totals across all devices (`+_sum+`)\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nature\n"
"| Bundle\n"
"| Bedeutung\n"
"\n"
"| `+ElectricityMeter+`\n"
"| `+io.openems.edge.meter.api+`\n"
"| Zähler: Leistung, Spannung, Strom, Energie; `+MeterType+` (GRID, PRODUCTION, CONSUMPTION_METERED …)\n"
"| `+SymmetricEss+`\n"
"| `+io.openems.edge.ess.api+`\n"
"| Speicher: SoC, Kapazität, Ist-Leistung\n"
"| `+ManagedSymmetricEss+`\n"
"| `+io.openems.edge.ess.api+`\n"
"| steuerbarer Speicher: Sollwert-Channels, `+applyPower()+`\n"
"| `+EssDcCharger+`\n"
"| `+io.openems.edge.ess.api+`\n"
"| DC-seitige PV am Hybrid-Wechselrichter\n"
"| `+Controller+`\n"
"| `+io.openems.edge.controller.api+`\n"
"| Regel-Logik in `+run()+`\n"
"| `+Sum+`\n"
"| `+io.openems.edge.common+`\n"
"| Summen über alle Geräte (`+_sum+`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:83
msgid ""
"**Important:** An implementation must list **all** Natures it provides in "
"the `+implements+` list, including the inherited parent interfaces (e.g. "
"`+ManagedSymmetricEss, SymmetricEss, OpenemsComponent+`). Recognition as an "
"OSGi service depends on the declared interfaces of the class, not on the "
"complete inheritance."
msgstr ""
"**Wichtig:** Eine Implementierung muss **alle** Natures, die sie anbietet, "
"in der `+implements+`-Liste aufzählen, auch die geerbten Eltern-Interfaces "
"(z. B. `+ManagedSymmetricEss, SymmetricEss, OpenemsComponent+`). Die "
"Erkennung als OSGi-Dienst richtet sich nach den deklarierten Interfaces der "
"Klasse, nicht nach der vollständigen Vererbung."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channels"
msgstr "Channels"

#. type: #sec-channels
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:88
msgid ""
"A Channel is defined as an enum constant in the interface (Nature or the "
"component's own interface):"
msgstr ""
"Ein Channel wird als Enum-Konstante im Interface (Nature oder "
"komponenteneigenes Interface) definiert:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:98
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"public interface MyMeter extends OpenemsComponent {\n"
"    enum ChannelId implements io.openems.edge.common.channel.ChannelId {\n"
"        TEMPERATURE(Doc.of(OpenemsType.INTEGER).unit(Unit.DEGREE_CELSIUS)),\n"
"        COMMUNICATION_FAILED(Doc.of(Level.FAULT).text(\"Communication failed\"));\n"
"        ...\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"public interface MyMeter extends OpenemsComponent {\n"
"    enum ChannelId implements io.openems.edge.common.channel.ChannelId {\n"
"        TEMPERATURE(Doc.of(OpenemsType.INTEGER).unit(Unit.DEGREE_CELSIUS)),\n"
"        COMMUNICATION_FAILED(Doc.of(Level.FAULT).text(\"Communication failed\"));\n"
"        ...\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:101
msgid ""
"The Channel Address has the form `+Component-ID/Channel-ID+`, where "
"`+ACTIVE_POWER+` becomes the Channel-ID `+ActivePower+`."
msgstr ""
"Die Adresse eines Channels ist `+Komponenten-ID/ChannelName+`, wobei aus "
"`+ACTIVE_POWER+` der Name `+ActivePower+` wird."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:103
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reading and writing"
msgstr "Lesen und Schreiben"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:122
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Method\n"
"| Effect\n"
"\n"
"| `+_setNextValue(v)+` / `+setNextValue(v)+`\n"
"| sets the **next** value; visible only after the Process Image is switched in the next Cycle\n"
"| `+value()+`\n"
"| returns the value of the **current** Process Image (stable for the entire Cycle)\n"
"| `+getNextValue()+`\n"
"| returns the next value that has not yet been adopted\n"
"| `+setNextWriteValue(v)+`\n"
"| only for write-channels: write request, e.g. a setpoint to a device\n"
"| `+getNextWriteValueAndReset()+`\n"
"| fetches the write request and resets it (typically in the device driver)\n"
"| `+onSetNextValue+`, `+onUpdate+`, `+onChange+`, `+onSetNextWrite+`\n"
"| callbacks\n"
msgstr ""
"| Methode\n"
"| Wirkung\n"
"\n"
"| `+_setNextValue(v)+` / `+setNextValue(v)+`\n"
"| setzt den **nächsten** Wert; sichtbar erst nach dem Wechsel des Prozessabbilds im nächsten Zyklus\n"
"| `+value()+`\n"
"| liefert den Wert des **aktuellen** Prozessabbilds (für den ganzen Zyklus stabil)\n"
"| `+getNextValue()+`\n"
"| liefert den noch nicht übernommenen nächsten Wert\n"
"| `+setNextWriteValue(v)+`\n"
"| nur bei Write-Channels: Schreibwunsch, z. B. Sollwert an ein Gerät\n"
"| `+getNextWriteValueAndReset()+`\n"
"| holt den Schreibwunsch ab und setzt ihn zurück (typisch im Gerätetreiber)\n"
"| `+onSetNextValue+`, `+onUpdate+`, `+onChange+`, `+onSetNextWrite+`\n"
"| Callbacks\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:125
#, no-wrap
msgid "Types"
msgstr "Arten"

#. type: #sec-types
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:128
msgid ""
"Read-channels (`+IntegerReadChannel+`, `+EnumReadChannel+` …) and write-"
"channels (`+IntegerWriteChannel+`, `+BooleanWriteChannel+` …), all in "
"`+io.openems.edge.common.channel+`."
msgstr ""
"Read-Channels (`+IntegerReadChannel+`, `+EnumReadChannel+` …) und Write-"
"Channels (`+IntegerWriteChannel+`, `+BooleanWriteChannel+` …), alle in "
"`+io.openems.edge.common.channel+`."

#. type: #sec-types
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:129
msgid ""
"**State-Channels** (`+Doc.of(Level.WARNING)+` etc.) are Boolean Channels "
"with severity INFO, WARNING or FAULT. If one is active, the overall state "
"`+State+` of the component goes to the highest level; `+_sum/State+` "
"combines all components."
msgstr ""
"**State-Channels** (`+Doc.of(Level.WARNING)+` usw.) sind Boolean-Channels "
"mit Schweregrad INFO, WARNING oder FAULT. Ist einer aktiv, geht der "
"Sammelzustand `+State+` der Komponente auf den höchsten Level; `+_sum/"
"State+` fasst alle Komponenten zusammen."

#. type: #sec-types
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:130
msgid ""
"The access mode (`+accessMode+`) READ_ONLY, READ_WRITE or WRITE_ONLY "
"determines whether the Channel can be written to via REST, for example."
msgstr ""
"Die Zugriffsart (`+accessMode+`) READ_ONLY, READ_WRITE oder WRITE_ONLY "
"bestimmt, ob der Channel z. B. über REST beschrieben werden kann."

#. type: #sec-types
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:131
msgid ""
"`+persistencePriority+` controls which Channels end up in the history and "
"Backend."
msgstr ""
"`+persistencePriority+` steuert, welche Channels in Historie und Backend "
"landen."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:133
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sum"
msgstr "Sum"

#. type: #sec-sum
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:136
msgid ""
"The component `+_sum+` (interface `+Sum+`) forms totals across all meters, "
"ESS and producers in each Cycle: `+GridActivePower+`, "
"`+ProductionActivePower+`, `+ConsumptionActivePower+`, `+EssSoc+`, energy "
"meters etc. The values are calculated shortly before the Process Image is "
"switched (`+updateChannelsBeforeProcessImage()+`). Controllers and UI use "
"`+_sum+` instead of individual devices where this is sufficient. What goes "
"into the totals is described on the user page xref:user/basics/energy-"
"flows.adoc[Basics]."
msgstr ""
"Die Komponente `+_sum+` (Interface `+Sum+`) bildet in jedem Zyklus Summen "
"über alle Zähler, Speicher und Erzeuger: `+GridActivePower+`, "
"`+ProductionActivePower+`, `+ConsumptionActivePower+`, `+EssSoc+`, Energie-"
"Zähler usw. Die Werte werden kurz vor dem Wechsel des Prozessabbilds "
"berechnet (`+updateChannelsBeforeProcessImage()+`). Controller und UI nutzen "
"`+_sum+` statt einzelner Geräte, wo das reicht. Was in die Summen eingeht, "
"beschreibt die Anwenderseite xref:user/basics/energy-flows.adoc[Grundlagen]."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:138
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration at runtime"
msgstr "Konfiguration zur Laufzeit"

#. type: #sec-configuration-at-runtime
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:141
msgid ""
"Configurations are changed via the Configuration Admin, see xref:edge/"
"configuration.adoc[Configuration]. The UI and JSON-RPC "
"(`+createComponentConfig+`, `+updateComponentConfig+`, "
"`+deleteComponentConfig+`) go through the `+ComponentManager+`."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurationen ändert man über den Configuration Admin, siehe "
"xref:latest@edge/configuration.adoc[Configuration]. Die UI und JSON-RPC "
"(`+createComponentConfig+`, `+updateComponentConfig+`, "
"`+deleteComponentConfig+`) gehen über den `+ComponentManager+`."

#. type: #sec-configuration-at-runtime
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:142
msgid ""
"After a change, OSGi calls `+@Modified+`, if present; otherwise the "
"component is deactivated and reactivated."
msgstr ""
"Nach einer Änderung ruft OSGi `+@Modified+` auf, falls vorhanden; sonst wird "
"die Komponente deaktiviert und neu aktiviert."

#. type: #sec-configuration-at-runtime
#: modules/ROOT/pages/development/fundamentals/components-and-channels.adoc:142
msgid ""
"`+ComponentManager.getEdgeConfig()+` returns the entire configuration "
"including all Channels. Building it is expensive; do not call it in every "
"Cycle."
msgstr ""
"`+ComponentManager.getEdgeConfig()+` liefert die gesamte Konfiguration "
"inklusive aller Channels. Der Aufbau ist aufwendig; nicht in jedem Zyklus "
"aufrufen."
